  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「ふんふふ～ん♪　あ～い、ら～びゅ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（やばっ、いま声でてた！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（音楽聞きながらゴロゴロしてると、つい気分よくなって流れてる曲と一緒に歌っちゃうよね～♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（いっけない、窓開いてるし！　外に聞こえちゃってたかも、恥ずかし～っ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（あぁ、もう外は真っ暗だな……。うげっ、ずいぶん夜更かししちゃった！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（明日も学校なのに～、どうして深夜のラジオってこんなに面白いんだろ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（笑い転げて夢中で聞いてるうちに、こんな時間。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（間に挟まる歌の選曲も冴えてるな～、すごいな～……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（あたしも、こんなふうに放送ができたらなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（『お昼の放送』の参考になるかもって、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（ラジオ番組を聞き始めたらすっかり目的を見失ってファンになっちゃったよ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（毎週、楽しみにしてます……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（ただ聞いてるだけじゃ駄目じゃん、いろいろ参考にしないと。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（あぁメモってたのに、読み直すと意味わかんない。時間を無駄にしちゃったなぁ、早く寝ないと）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（焦っても、仕方ないよね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（ちょっとずつでもお勉強して、プロの仕事を参考にしつつ、何度も放送を繰り返して経験値を溜めて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（こつこつ、がんばろっと♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（ん～、ラジオ聞いてたらテンションあがっちゃった。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（目が冴えちゃってるな～、何かクラシックとか聞こうかな……。リラクゼーション系のやつ、入れてたっけ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（えぇっと、駄目だテンションあがるやつしか入れてない。好きなんだもん、そういうの……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（ん～、そろそろ音楽聞くやつも買い換えよっかな。メモリ満杯だし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（でもお小遣い、けっこう放送部の活動に使ってて余裕ないしなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（……あれっ？　向かいのお屋敷にも明かりついてる、お嬢も起きてるのかな？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お～い、お嬢！　さっさとお布団に入らないと駄目だよ、また寝坊するよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「まぁ、あたしには関係ないけどねっ？」"
  },
